{"event":"snapshot","tag":"poll0","url":"https://harbor-trainer-s2eobzrxbq-uc.a.run.app/trainer#","hits":["gen-g857-department-directory-categorization-audit","gen-g857-department-directory-categorization-audit","UPLOAD-THIS-TO-QC-gen-g857-5d6077-v7-sna-rihn","gs://obi-harbor-pipeline/tasks/qc_platform_sync/UPLOAD-THIS-TO-QC-gen-g857-5d6077-v7-sna-rihn/","Reward-bearing verifier-only requirements exist. tests/verifier.json check 'memo_has_explanatory_body' expects regex '(?s)^(?=[\\s\\S]{2200,})' — a 2200-character memo floor that neither instruction.md nor the binding standard states. Additionally memo_explains_true_token_only, memo_explains_whitespace_prior_blocks, memo_explains_internal_id_spaces and memo_explains_case_insensitive_parents require memo coverage of topics beyond the instruction's enumerated set ('the trim, alias last-wins, blank-id, and literal slide-parent edge cases'). Conversely, all instruction requirements (three files, per-department findings, five derived counts) are graded.","Every instruction requirement is tested (three files exist; 62 per-department findings; five results.json counts; audit/results consistency). However 'memo_has_explanatory_body' is a reward-bearing verifier-only requirement (regex '(?s)^(?=[\\s\\S]{2200,})', a length floor stated nowhere), and four memo checks grade topics (true-token exactness, whitespace-only prior, internal id spaces, case-insensitive parent equality) that instruction.md does not list among the edge cases it asks the memo to cover.","The 14 memo checks are ordered keyword regexes with character-distance windows, which is both brittle and, in places, weaker than claimed: memo_explains_true_token_only's second group includes the bare alternatives '1' and 'Y' under (?i), so almost any sentence containing 'true' followed by a word with a 'y' satisfies it; memo_explains_misplaced_department accepts a bare '-' within 280 chars. So correct-but-differently-worded memos fail (proved by evaluations/difficulty/r3) while [REDACTED] prose can pass. The audit regexes additionally assume unquoted CSV output.","UPLOAD-THIS-TO-QC-gen-g857-6bc9ad-v2-sna-kxuy","gs://obi-harbor-pipeline/tasks/qc_platform_sync/UPLOAD-THIS-TO-QC-gen-g857-6bc9ad-v2-sna-kxuy/"]}
